  "caveats": [
    "These undated NYSBOE pages list system families, not election-specific deployment inventories. The 2026 workspace year is not the source publication year.",
    "Exact county models, installed software/firmware, quantities, pollbooks, and uniformity across polling places and voting modes are not established.",
    "Clear Ballot central-count/audit-only listings are separate from the listed poll-site system family and do not prove that an audit occurred.",
    "The legacy official ES&S AutoMARK page at /node/276 also lists Nassau. The current voting-technology hub links to the ES&S family page, which excludes Nassau, and the Clear Ballot page lists Nassau in its full suite. The source conflict is retained; retirement and election-effective dates are unresolved.",
    "No votes, turnout, results, advisory indicators, or 2024 equipment rows are created or carried forward by this package."
